      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, but it feels a little bit generic. Can you make it more aggressive? Specifically, I want you to add a section about how the current \"progressive\" or \"liberal\" approach to justice is actually destroying the city and making it unsafe for families. Really lean into the idea that their policies are the reason crime is out of control.",
